@Alex-302 I found these sites through Yandex search while looking for a live stream of a football match. They come up in the results for searches like "canlı maç izle".

Sites like these change domains often. Your Turkish filter already has regex rules for other Selçuksports sites under "Frequently changed domains" (selcuksporthd*.com, hdselcuksports*.top). That's why the rules in these reports use a regex domain too, so they keep working after the next change.

#247854, #247855, #247856, #247857, #247859 and #247861 are all the same few networks. Could you take another look please?
